  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - 1.\tThe proposed roof extension, compromising a rear dormer, by reason of its size and bulk, would be disproportionately large in relation to the roof, and constitute an obtrusive feature which would be out of character with, and detrimental to the appearance of, the house and the established roofline of the adjoining properties and the street scene and generally contrary to policies ENV - B.1.1 and H.6.4 of the Unitary Development Plan. Section 5 of the Residential Extension Guidelines.",
    "Condition : 2 - 2.\tThe proposed rear dormer extension, by reason of its excessive size, when taken together with the existing extensions to the house, would constitute an overdevelopment of the site generally contrary to policies ENV - B.1.1 and H.6.4 of the Unitary Development Plan. Section 5 of the Residential Extension Guidelines."
